# Person devices log in or pair; farm automation uses a separate service profile.
# This gitignored file may hold the co-launched node's machine credential and
# unrelated private provider settings. Never put a gateway login token here.
# Install the node credential with credential issue --write-node-env.
# A co-launched native node also needs its server-assigned owner declaration.
# On macOS, remote node owners are retained from the installed service unless
# explicitly replaced by the caller; gateway-side auth defaults do not override them.
# See docs/reference/identity-and-credentials.md for login, rotation and recovery.
